hungerpoints.licence.legend_header=Legend
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text1=This only applies when the §6Detailed Item Names§r mode is active.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text1_1=This only applies when the §6Hunger & Saturation Only§r mode is active.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text2=§lShown on Food Items
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text3= Hunger Points replenished after consuming the item.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text3_1= Saturation Points replenished after consuming the item.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text4= Time needed to consume the item.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text4_1= This icon only appears if the food is harmful to eat.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text5=§lShown on Armor
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text6= Armor Points a piece of Armor gives after putting it on.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text6_1= Amount of damage absorbed.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text7=§lShown on Tools, Weapons and Gear
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text8= Amount of Attack Damage the tool deals when unenchanted.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text9= Additional Attack Damage from Sharpness. Sharpness I-V adds 1, 2, 3, 5, 6 respectively.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text10= Maximum Durability of the item. Value does not decrease after use.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text11=§lShown on Spawn Eggs
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text12= Amount of Health Points the mob has.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text13= This means the mob is Hostile.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text14= This means the mob is Neutral.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text15= This means the mob is Passive.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text15_1= This means the mob is a Boss.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text15_2=§lShown on Furnace Fuel Items
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text15_3= Shows how many items that can be smelted.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text16=§lShown on Banner Items
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17= Shows icons for the respective patterns.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_1=§lShown on Blocks & Items that Emit Light
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_2= Shows icons depending on the light level emitted.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_3=§lShown on Music Discs
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_4= Duration of the song. The time does not count down when played.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_5=§lShown on Fireworks
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_6= Shows icons for the respective patterns.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_7=§lShown on Potions & Tipped Arrows
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_8= Shows icons depending on the potion effect. Some do not have icons as the effect is self-explanatory.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_9= The entity releases a burst of wind upon death.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_10= The entity spawns 2-3 cobwebs upon death.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_11= The entity spawns 2 slimes upon death.
hungerpoints.licence.legend_text17_12= The entity has a 10% chance to spawn 1-3 silverfish when hurt.
