hungerpoints.dlc_header=Downloadable Content (DLCs)
hungerpoints.dlc_text1=There is currently 1 DLC available. These are additional packs that work together with Item Info+ to further enhance your gameplay experience.
hungerpoints.dlc_text2= §eDownload the DLC now on §a MCPEDL§r or §6honkit26113.com§r!
hungerpoints.dlc_text3=§lDLC: §eRedstone Info+§r
hungerpoints.dlc_text4=Show more information on redstone items! New textures and icons have been added to make building with redstone easier.
hungerpoints.dlc_text5=§lDLC: §eEnchantment Info+§r
hungerpoints.dlc_text6=Show more information on enchantments! Find out what gear the enchantment can be applied to, and the function of the enchantment, all displayed using simple and colorful icons!



hungerpoints.licence.addon_header=Add-on Cross-compatibility
hungerpoints.licence.addon_text1=Item Info+ also supports the §6Beyond The Underground§r add-on. In the World Settings of the world you wish to activate the add-on in, put the resource packs in the following order.
hungerpoints.licence.addon_text2=Stats of items should now appear on the names of custom items!
hungerpoints.licence.addon_text3= §6Beyond The Underground§r is an add-on that adds many new cave types for you to explore! Available now on §a MCPEDL§r.
hungerpoints.licence.addon_text4= Note to players using §6The Ty-el's Vietnamese Language Pack§r: Item Info+ must be placed §6on top of§r the language pack.



